{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","舞动生息"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对范围内友军施加强化，并进行治疗。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一个方向，为面前3格扇形范围内的友军恢复-300% − 30% ATK的生命值，并在该区域内施加元气魔法，使其中的友军提升12%攻击力，持续8秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":33,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","持续时间延长至9秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","使范围内的友军提升14%攻击力。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","范围内的友军还会提升15点攻击速度。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","持续时间延长至10秒。"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","宝石愈疗"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对一名友军施加持续治疗。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","为最虚弱的1名友方英雄施加治愈法术，使该英雄在接下来的4 + 1.5秒内每秒恢复50% ATK的生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":34,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":1,"end":5,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":40,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每秒恢复量提升至55% ATK的生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":15,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每秒恢复量提升至60% ATK的生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":15,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每秒恢复量提升至65% ATK的生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":15,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","璀璨绽放"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","发射一枚宝石，对范围内敌人造成伤害，对友军产生治疗。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","向最近的一名敌人发射一枚宝石，命中后产生爆炸，并对半径1格范围内的所有敌人造成150% + 15% ATK伤害，并对范围内的所有友军恢复150% + 15% ATK的生命值。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":43,"end":49,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":72,"end":78,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":39,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":68,"end":82,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至155% + 15% ATK，治疗效果提升至155% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":31,"end":37,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":27,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","宝石会根据主目标的伤害类型而变化成不同形态，并对受影响目标产生不同的额外效果：若主目标造成物理伤害则变为红宝石，降低敌人10%护甲并提升友军10%护甲，持续5秒；若主目标造成魔法伤害则变为蓝宝石，降低敌人10%魔抗并提升友军10%魔抗，持续5秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至160% + 15% ATK，治疗效果提升至160% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":31,"end":37,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":27,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身生命值。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的生命值提升17%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的生命值提升23%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的生命值提升29%。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","华丽开场"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","开局时对身前的友军施加单体的强化和持续治疗效果。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，立即对布阵在自己身前一格上的友方英雄施加“舞动生息”和“宝石愈疗”技能的持续增益效果。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"keyword:frontonehex"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","同时还会使该友方英雄提高15点受愈，持续至战斗结束。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","该友方英雄获得的受愈提高至20点。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","该友方英雄获得的受愈提高至25点。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“宝石愈疗”持续期间，目标生命值过低时会获得一次强力治疗。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“宝石愈疗”施加的治愈法术持续期间，目标生命值百分比首次低于50%时，会立即获得一次强力治疗，恢复自身200% ATK的生命值。每次释放该技能，最多只能触发一次强力治疗的效果。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":53,"end":61,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","拉拉指挥棒"]]}